msgstr "Default in the profile (OK, schedule; also changeable in Actions). Satellite is always the first source: Enigma2 gives EIT priority over imports, while XMLTV fills gaps and later days only. Disabled: XMLTV import only, without tuner scans or top-ups; if Force EIT off is Yes, EIT is disabled and EPG comes only from XMLTV."

